    "created_at": "2021-01-20T21:33:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-20T21:33:23Z",
    "body": "I mean, making the rendered legend just `fieldset > legend:first-of-type` is another option, but that doesn't match implementations, which support e.g. `display: contents` around a legend.",
