    "created_at": "2021-01-21T09:39:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-21T09:39:29Z",
    "body": "Oh, right. Hmm. Well, if it's only forced blockification that is always applied, that could still be usable enough for a new element wanting to re-use `legend`.",
